B.adX=s(["Private cloud backup is separate from publication. Only explicitly submitted works enter review and become public after approval and publication.","For GLB publication, 26 rendered views of the final model, together with its title and description, are submitted to Aliyun text/image moderation. These views are not original capture photos. Unsupported formats cannot be automatically published through this route.","Risk may require human review; prohibited content is rejected; errors or incomplete results do not automatically publish. Changed content requires a new review. Publication does not waive privacy or other people's rights.","Titles are limited to 100 characters; descriptions to 30.","Content prohibited by law may not be published.","Obtain consent from people appearing in a scene before publishing it publicly.","Exported 3D model files carry a provenance marker, as required by Chinese regulations on deep synthesis services. It does not affect normal use of the file."],t.s)
B.azz=new A.l6("2. Publishing and Review",B.adX)
B.am6=s(["Available measures: warning, required correction within a period, feature restriction, suspension, account closure.","Violating works are taken down and their files removed from public storage; previously saved links stop working.","You may request withdrawal or deletion, including pending works. Stopping public access and physical erasure are separate; review evidence, dispute records and historical backups are handled as described in the Privacy Policy.","Account-related actions are logged and retained for at least 6 months."],t.s)
B.azC=new A.l6("3. Enforcement",B.am6)
B.aeW=s(["Every work page provides a reporting entry with categories including spam, harassment, hate speech, sexual content, violence, copyright and misinformation.","You may also block a user; their works will no longer appear in your feed.","To appeal an enforcement decision, use the contact below."],t.s)
B.azA=new A.l6("4. Reporting and Appeals",B.aeW)
B.am_=s(["Email: wkd20040211@163.com","We respond to reports and appeals as promptly as we can."],t.s)
B.azw=new A.l6("5. Contact",B.am_)
B.alJ=s([B.azx,B.azz,B.azC,B.azA,B.azw],t.sl)
